# Sign Up

msgid "Sign Up"
msgstr "Roʻyxatdan oʻtish"

msgid "Create Account"
msgstr "Hisob yaratish"

msgid "Fill in the details below to register"
msgstr "Roʻyxatdan oʻtish uchun quyidagi maʼlumotlarni toʻldiring"

msgid "I have read and agree to the"
msgstr "Men shartlar bilan tanishdim va roziman:"

msgid "Terms of Service"
msgstr "Foydalanish shartlari"

msgid "Already have an account?"
msgstr "Sizda allaqachon hisob bormi?"

msgid "Log in"
msgstr "Tizimga kirish"

msgid "You must agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy to continue."
msgstr ""
"Davom etish uchun Foydalanish shartlari va Maxfiylik siyosatiga rozilik "
"bildirishingiz shart."

msgid ""
"Your password must contain at least 8 characters and cannot be entirely "
"numeric, too similar to your personal info, or commonly used."
msgstr ""
"Parolingiz kamida 8 ta belgidan iborat bo'lishi va faqat raqamlardan, "
"shaxsiy ma'lumotlaringizga o'xshash yoki keng tarqalgan parollardan iborat "
"bo'lmasligi kerak."

msgid "Required. 150 characters or fewer. Letters, digits and @/./+/-/_ only."
msgstr ""
"Majburiy. 150 ta belgidan oshmasligi kerak. Faqat harflar, raqamlar va "
"@/./+/-/_ belgilari."

msgid "This username is already taken. Please choose another."
msgstr "Bu foydalanuvchi nomi band. Iltimos, boshqa nom tanlang."

msgid "Account created successfully!"
msgstr "Hisob muvaffaqiyatli yaratildi!"

# Password Reset

msgid "Forgot Password?"
msgstr "Parolni unutdingizmi?"

msgid ""
"Enter your email address below and we'll send you instructions to reset your"
" password."
msgstr ""
"Quyida email manzilingizni kiriting, parolni tiklash bo'yicha ko'rsatmalarni"
" yuboramiz."

msgid ""
"If an account exists with this email, you will receive a password reset link"
" shortly."
msgstr ""
"Agar bu email bilan hisob mavjud bo'lsa, tez orada parol tiklash havolasini "
"olasiz."

msgid "Send Reset Link"
msgstr "Tiklash havolasini yuborish"

msgid "Need Help?"
msgstr "Yordam kerakmi?"

msgid "Password Reset Email Sent"
msgstr "Parolni tiklash xabari yuborildi"

msgid "Check Your Email"
msgstr "Email manzilingizni tekshiring"

msgid ""
"We've emailed you instructions for setting your password. You should receive"
" them shortly."
msgstr ""
"Parolni o'rnatish bo'yicha ko'rsatmalarni emailingizga yubordik. Tez orada "
"yetib keladi."

msgid ""
"If you don't receive an email, please make sure you've entered the address "
"you registered with, and check your spam folder."
msgstr ""
"Agar xat kelmasa, ro'yxatdan o'tgan email manzilingizni tekshiring va spam "
"papkasiga qarang."

msgid "Back to Login"
msgstr "Kirish sahifasiga qaytish"

msgid "Resend Email"
msgstr "Qayta yuborish"

msgid "Set New Password"
msgstr "Yangi parol o'rnatish"

msgid ""
"Please enter your new password twice so we can verify you typed it "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"Iltimos, yangi parolni ikki marta kiriting (to'g'ri yozilganini tekshirish "
"uchun)."

msgid "Password Requirements"
msgstr "Parol talablari"

msgid "Password Reset Complete"
msgstr "Parol tiklandi"

msgid "Password Reset Successful!"
msgstr "Parol muvaffaqiyatli yangilandi!"

msgid ""
"Your password has been set successfully. You can now log in with your new "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Parolingiz muvaffaqiyatli o'rnatildi. Endi yangi parolingiz bilan tizimga "
"kirishingiz mumkin."

msgid "Sign In Now"
msgstr "Hozir kirish"

msgid "Keep your new password secure and don't share it with anyone."
msgstr "Yangi parolingizni xavfsiz saqlang va hech kimga bermang."

# Change Password

msgid "Change Password"
msgstr "Parolni oʻzgartirish"

msgid "Enter your current password, then your new password twice."
msgstr "Avval eski parolni, keyin yangi parolni ikki marta kiriting."

msgid "Update Password"
msgstr "Parolni yangilash"

msgid "Back to Profile"
msgstr "Profilga qaytish"

msgid "Password Tips"
msgstr "Parol bo'yicha maslahatlar"

msgid "Use at least 8 characters"
msgstr "Kamida 8 ta belgidan foydalaning"

msgid "Mix uppercase and lowercase letters"
msgstr "Katta va kichik harflarni aralashtiring"

msgid "Include numbers and symbols (!@#$%^&*)"
msgstr "Raqamlar va maxsus belgilardan foydalaning (!@#$%^&*)"

msgid "Avoid personal information or common words"
msgstr "Shaxsiy ma'lumotlar yoki oddiy so'zlardan foydalanmang"

msgid "Password Updated!"
msgstr "Parol yangilandi!"

msgid ""
"Your password has been changed successfully. You can now sign in with your "
"new password."
msgstr ""
"Parolingiz muvaffaqiyatli o'zgartirildi. Endi yangi parolingiz bilan "
"kirishingiz mumkin."

msgid ""
"For security, please remember your new password or store it in a safe place."
msgstr ""
"Xavfsizlik uchun yangi parolingizni eslab qoling yoki xavfsiz joyga yozib "
"qo'ying."

msgid "Your password was successfully updated!"
msgstr "Parolingiz muvaffaqiyatli yangilandi!"

